<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted">Practitioner-led scent design</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Lab</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html" style="color:var(--accent)">About</a>
        <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="lead reveal" id="intro">
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Intentional scent practice, explained</h1>
          <p class="muted">My work begins with listening. I design approachable scent supports that may help people feel steadier in moments they care about — not as a treatment, but as an adjunct practice used with care.</p>
          <div class="profile" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="avatar">PR</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:800">Practitioner</div>
              <div class="muted">Certified aromatherapist • Plant ally research</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="card" style="height:100%">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">What to expect</h3>
          <ul class="muted">
            <li>Safety-first intake</li>
            <li>Practical dilution & patch-test guidance</li>
            <li>Tangible routines you can use at home</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="cta" href="book.html">Book a consult</a></p>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Method & approach</h2>
        <div class="card timeline">
          <p class="muted">My method is rooted in plant knowledge and client-centered design. Each offering follows a clear path: intake, experiential session, and a written plan. For immersive work we schedule collaborative formulation sessions where the client is present for blend decisions and safety checks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process">
          <div class="step">
            <strong>Intake</strong>
            <p class="muted">We map history, sensitivities, and goals; note pets/pregnancy restrictions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <strong>Trial & refine</strong>
            <p class="muted">Short scent exposures and adjustments with dilution testing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <strong>Routine</strong>
            <p class="muted">A clear step-by-step plan with blend ratios and storage notes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Who I work with</h2>
        <p class="muted">People seeking simple, sustainable scent practices — those who want reliable supports for focus, calm, or ritual. We avoid promising cures or medical outcomes. If you have serious health concerns, please consult your clinician.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Social proof</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <blockquote style="margin:0;padding:0 0 6px 0">"The VIP Day helped me leave with blends I actually use daily — thoughtful, practical, and safe."</blockquote>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">— Client in {{CITY}}</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>FAQ snapshot</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p><strong>Do you make medical claims?</strong> <span class="muted">No. Aromatherapy may support subjective well-being but is not a medical treatment.</span></p>
          <p><strong>What about pets and pregnancy?</strong> <span class="muted">We screen for these, avoid certain oils around cats, and provide safe alternatives. Always consult a provider when pregnant.</span></p>
          <p><strong>How do you approach dilution?</strong> <span class="muted">We provide clear dilution ratios and a patch-test protocol for every blend.</span></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Ready to connect?</h2>
        <p class="muted">If you'd like a tailored conversation, schedule a time. For intensive planning, inquire about the VIP Day.</p>
        <p><a class="cta" href="book.html">Schedule a conversation</a></p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>. Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Reveal system honoring reduced motion
    (function(){
      const items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      if(prefersReduced){ items.forEach(i=>i.classList.add('visible')); return; }
      const ob = new IntersectionObserver((es)=>{ es.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting) e.target.classList.add('visible'); }); },{threshold:0.12});
      items.forEach(i=>ob.observe(i));
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
